    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30895" root="عهن" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِهْنَةٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِهْنٌ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also <i>A certain tree</i> (K,
TA) <i>in the desert,</i> (TA,) <i>having a red</i> [<i>flower
such as is termed</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَرْدَة</span>; (K, TA;) mentioned by
Az as having been seen by him: said by AHn to
be <i>a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَقْلَة</span> [i. e. <i>herb,</i> or <i>leguminous plant</i>]: and by
IB to be <i>of the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَقْل</span> <i>termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذُكُور</span>. (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  And
a dial. var. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِحْنَةٌ</span>; (K, TA;) meaning <i>Rancour,
malevolence, malice,</i> or <i>spite:</i> and <i>anger.</i> (TA.)

